SUMMARY:Dennis Dissertation Defense
DESCRIPTION:Kathryn Dennis\, a candidate in the Doctor of Education in Le
 adership Program\, will defend her dissertation at 2:00 PM on Friday\, Ma
 y 11\, 2026 in York 121.  Her dissertation is titled "The Multiracial Ins
 tructional Leader Style: A Heuristic Phenomenological Study Dissertation"
  and the chair of her committee is Dr. Mollie Galloway.  This event is op
 en to the public.  The presentation may be viewed via Zoom (https://lclar
 k-edu.zoom.us/j/93907659183?pwd=PGRnHTdamMBFasbZMz4VeI4EgT2AVa.1).
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Kathryn Dennis\, a candidate in the Doc
 tor of Education in Leadership Program\, will defend her dissertation at 
 2:00 PM on Friday\, May 11\, 2026 in York 121.</p><p>  Her dissertation i
 s titled "The Multiracial Instructional Leader Style: A Heuristic Phenome
 nological Study Dissertation" and the chair of her committee is Dr. Molli
 e Galloway.</p><p>  This event is open to the public.</p><p>  The present
 ation may be viewed <a href="https://lclark-edu.zoom.us/j/93907659183?pwd
 =PGRnHTdamMBFasbZMz4VeI4EgT2AVa.1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">via Zoo
 m</a>.</p>
