SUMMARY:Farewell Event for Renée Orlick
DESCRIPTION:A farewell event for Assistant Vice President of Institutiona
 l Research and Planning Renée Orlick will be held on May 14 at 3:30 p.m.
  on the Manor House patio (or in the Armstrong Lounge if the weather does
 n't cooperate).  Renée has been in the AVP role since 2021\, having prev
 iously worked as director of Institutional Research at Lewis &amp\; Clark
  for eight years. She will be greatly missed by her many colleagues at L&
 amp\;C.  Please RSVP here (https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeAjF
 KF56xGvDZp3TAhhHD-pfTuUdkJbcf_n3CCtLktVA6a6w/viewform?usp=publish-editor)
  if you are able to join us for appetizers and beverages to celebrate Ren
 ée's service to Lewis &amp\; Clark.  Read more about the recent Changes 
 in Institutional Research and Planning (https://www.lclark.edu/live/news/
 58025-farewell-event-for-renee-orlick-and-changes-in).&#160\;
