SUMMARY:FREE Summer Open Studio Art Sessions in the Art Hive
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our upcoming summer open studio art sessions. His
 torically held during the academic year\, we are excited to extend these 
 gatherings into the summer months to provide a consistent space for creat
 ivity and connection.  Hosted by BA Short\, Adjunct Instructor in the G
 raduate Art Therapy program\, these 7 in-person sessions will take place 
 on the 2nd and 4th Thursdays from 3:00 PM – 6:00 PM (dates below).  All
  art materials are provided\, and no prior art-making experience is neces
 sary—just a willingness to explore and be curious.  **Space is limited 
 to registration is required.Registration:Pre-registration is required (ht
