X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>\n  Prepare for the unexpected with this engaging\
 , hands-on introduction to wilderness medicine\, taught by the National O
 utdoor Leadership School (NOLS). If you like to take short trips relative
 ly close to medical resources\, work at wilderness camps\, enjoy weekend 
 family outdoor activities\, or recreate outdoors\, this course is for you
 .\n</p>
