 ax-h="760" loading="lazy" data-optimized="true"/></picture><strong>Dawn M
 ontgomery\, EdD</strong> is a change facilitator and insightful thought p
 artner. She supports leaders from a wide variety of fields\, including ed
 ucators\, nonprofit executives\, and community administrators as they fin
 d their way in challenging times. Assisting humans in their discovery and
  reconnection to their deepest longings has been a passion for many years
 . Her background in K-12 and college education as teacher\, principal\, a
 nd district leader support her coaching practice and team facilitation. S
 he believes transformation is born when a circle of humans sit together t
 o listen\, to speak their deepest truths and to share their wildest imagi
 nations for the world. She is expert at holding space for both individual
  leaders and teams as an executive coach\, conflict mediator\, equity-foc
 used professional developer and a certified Courage &amp\; Renewal facili
 tator. She is committed to making a difference in the lives of individual
 s and their communities.</p><p style="line-height: 1.5\;"><strong>&#160\;
