 ark.edu)&#160\;with questions.Please note: Discounted &#x2018\;Student Ra
 te&#x2019\; registrations are for current students only and do not includ
 e continuing education credit (CEU/PDUs)About the InstructorJames Gurule\
 , MA\, LPC (https://parallelpatterns.com/#)\, is a licensed professional 
 counselor with over four decades of clinical experience working in commun
 ity mental health. Practicing as a child and family therapist\, James als
 o provided clinical supervision with agency staff and was designated as L
 ead Risk Manager at Lifeworks NW.  James regularly provides professional 
