 ength-based supervisory and clinical practices. James has taught many cou
 rses for Lewis &amp\; Clark Graduate School's Center for Community Engage
 ment\, and Lifeworks NW.New workshops and trainings are added to our cale
 ndar regularly. For the latest on professional development related to you
 r specific interests\, sign up for our mailing list! (https://lclark.tfaf
